[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642774907","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2642774907","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2642774907,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dhYt7","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T12:20:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T12:20:14Z","body":"Not sure what to do about the sanitizer thing. The leak is also present on master, there is just no test case that triggers it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642774907/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642948096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2642948096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2642948096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6diDAA","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T13:31:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T13:31:33Z","body":"Probably also fixes my issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97053. There also some other issues that sounds very much the same, so we should probably evaluate those as well after the merged.\r\nWill test as soon as the build is green.\r\n\r\nI expect that the whole script is reloaded, since I changed and saved it. Therefore, it need to be fully recompiled.\r\nSo at least for me, your proposed fix is fine and expected. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642948096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643165818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2643165818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2643165818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6di4J6","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T14:53:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T14:54:24Z","body":"Thanks for looking into this issue.\r\n\r\nI tested the MRP from #100750 with this PR and the error message is not there anymore, but now, this warning is always printed:\r\n`\r\nWARNING: modules\\gdscript\\gdscript.cpp:1638 - Canceling suspended execution of \"refresh_filesystem\" due to a script reload.\r\n`\r\n\r\nI'm not an expert, but cancelling awaits on script reload sounds a good idea! The problem with this solution for #100750 is that the script is reloaded for no valid reason, cancelling the `refresh_filesystem` method, resulting in never printing `EditorPlugin.res_filesystem.update_file(filepath)`.\r\n\r\nFinally, because of your added warning (thanks), that the issue from #100750 was caused because the plugin script was loaded twice on startup if the same script is used in the plugin ready and has an autoload. Autoloads are created really early, before the first scan, which causes the first load. When the plugin enabled,, the script is loaded with `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE`, causing the script to reload while awais are running.\r\n\r\nFirst load:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4810d19-527e-496c-b10d-1773603bf6a2)\r\n\r\nSecond load:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70e6f4eb-a421-4c95-bcb7-39ac1ec59f49)\r\n\r\nI changed the cache mode when enabling plugins on editor startup and that fixes #100750. I'll create a separate PR just for that fix because, the way I see it, the double reloading is a separate issue.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643165818/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643180752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2643180752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2643180752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6di7zQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T14:59:42Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T15:14:04Z","body":"Yep I was aware that this doesn't make the code from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100750 work, but it fails consistently with this PR, which is preferable to crashes. Fixing the actual reload thing is a separate thing, but as I stated over there I'd be careful with changing this cache mode thing. It was introduced in #73776 to fix some bug, so we need to carefully test whether removing it would reintroduce the original bug (which seems far worse, given that #100750 can be somewhat worked around by waiting for a few cycles before calling to the editor plugin script).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643180752/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643325214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2643325214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2643325214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6djfEe","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T15:57:03Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T16:04:53Z","body":"The leak may be caused by the same reference cycles I outlined in this issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101830\r\n\r\nIt's quite difficult to check though, so I can't guarantee it's the case. But if it's triggered with `master` code before the PR, I think it's fair to conclude this PR doesn't cause it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643325214/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643391259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2643391259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2643391259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6djvMb","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T16:21:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T16:21:52Z","body":"I am able to get the exact same leaks on `master`, when copying over the test case and removing the `finished.emit()` line. Given that this doesn't seem related to this PR, I disabled the test case for now. We can try enabling it again once #101830 is addressed or other leak related fixes get merged.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643391259/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787222017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102521#issuecomment-2787222017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102521","id":2787222017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mIaIB","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c